title: mf repo wear
tags: [[CLI command]]
kind: reference
summary: Say how worn the selected repository's store is


Prints how worn the store is: what writes left pending for the idle fold, and how
many dense ids no metarecord holds any more (`--json` for the answer as it is). It
is how a client waits for the fold, so it does not count as the user's activity
([[Storage wear]]); a reindex frees the ids and the records of the deleted
metarecords ([[Checking and reindexing a repository]]).
